{"unit_id": "940842546__dsh-permissions#feature-1", "repo": "940842546/dsh-permissions", "commit": "e86bed9b5b429b647ad2621144861a127725558c", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-permissions 的功能「规则判定」：宿主在工具执行前根据工具名称、参数及全局或 workspace 规则作出放行、拒绝或询问决定。规则可按优先级匹配；路径规则支持通配符。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:371", "lib/match.js:121"]}
